# BattleTech 13.1.8 on the Tesla 3.0 pod: the game's Remote I/O ids, by name.
# docs/HARDWARE_MAPPING.md, "The cockpit state and command interface";
# what each id is, and how sure that is: docs/COCKPIT_INTERFACE.md.
#
#   lamp ID NAME            D3 ID level        the lamp in a key (0-3)
#   button ID NAME          B1/B0 ID           a key's press and release
#   text ID[,ID...] NAME    D1 ID 8 chars      several ids make one longer text
#   field ID NAME           D4 ID 2 chars
#   bar ID NAME             D2 ID count
#   axis ID NAME LO HI      C0 ID value
# A key and its lamp share an id, and so a name.

# function keys - the first milestone's MFD
lamp 00 func.radar
button 00 func.radar
lamp 04 func.map
button 04 func.map
lamp 08 func.damage
button 08 func.damage
lamp 40 func.target
button 40 func.target
lamp 3C func.radar2km
button 3C func.radar2km
lamp 3D func.zoomin
button 3D func.zoomin
lamp 43 func.zoomout
button 43 func.zoomout
lamp 10 func.indirect
button 10 func.indirect

# advanced functions
lamp 20 func.searchlight
button 20 func.searchlight
lamp 28 func.centre
button 28 func.centre
lamp 1C torso.right
button 1C torso.right
lamp 51 torso.left
button 51 torso.left

# pilot interface modes
lamp 32 mode.basic
button 32 mode.basic
lamp 33 mode.advanced
button 33 mode.advanced
lamp 30 mode.crosshairs
button 30 mode.crosshairs
lamp 31 mode.stickturns
button 31 mode.stickturns

# text
text 8C,8D,8E message
text 90 engine
field 8F readout
